# portable-mode marker (docs/plans/2026-09-11-portable-bundle.md): only ever written by build_portable.py
# into the bundle; a copy next to run.py switches a checkout to portable paths and must stay local.
# Anchored to the repo root: glasstranslate/config/ is a source package and must never match.
/portable.txt
/config/
/logs/
# Local corpus of third-party volumes used to eyeball the typesetter (~16 GB of
# .cbz/.rar).  Anchored to the repo root; never committed.
/JA vs. EN/
# Ground truth and OCR caches derived from those licensed pages.
# typeset_reference.derive() writes eng_aligned.png - a full warped copy of the reference
# page - under demo/reference/<stem>/, and the corpus harness would otherwise stage
# thousands of them.  Anchored to the repo root.  (Ignoring a path does not untrack what is
# already tracked: the files committed before this rule existed are still in the index.)
/demo/reference/
/demo/cache/

# The autonomous-run scaffolding: the method manual, the session hand-off, the cycle-by-cycle
# lab notebook and the supervisor that drove the run.  Kept locally and never published - it is
# process rather than project, and the notebook quotes reference text from the licensed corpus.
# Anchored to the repo root.
/docs/NOTES.md
/docs/NOTES.md
/docs/RUN_COMPLETE
/docs/perf/2026-09-15-typeset-corpus.md
/progress.md
/.mcp.json
/tools/autorun-mcp/
# per-cycle renders of before.png written by that run
/incremental/
